    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">When two 3D shapes are similar, the linear scale factor k applies to corresponding lengths, and their volumes relate by k<sup>3</sup>. We can solve problems by using volume ratios to find k or missing quantities.</p>",
